pe-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-380\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mtgride.org\/scams\/investment\/\" class=\"elementor-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Investment<\/a><\/li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-375\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mtgride.org\/scams\/billing-scam\/\" class=\"elementor-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Billing Scam<\/a><\/li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-376\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mtgride.org\/scams\/company-fraud\/\" class=\"elementor-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Company Fraud<\/a><\/li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-378\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mtgride.org\/scams\/fake-charities\/\" class=\"elementor-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Fake Charities<\/a><\/li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-379\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mtgride.org\/scams\/identity-theft\/\" class=\"elementor-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Identity Theft<\/a><\/li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-381\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mtgride.org\/scams\/superannuation\/\" class=\"elementor-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Superannuation<\/a><\/li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-374\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mtgride.org\/scams\/betting-sport\/\" class=\"elementor-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Betting &#038; Sport<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t<\/nav>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c3d0ea4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c3d0ea4\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c564ccf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c564ccf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a51ab1c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a51ab1c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-00d9d30 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"00d9d30\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e33425f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e33425f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3><strong>Don\u2019t fall for fake invoices sent to steal your money.<\/strong><\/h3><p>Fake billing schemes force you to pay fraudulent invoices for various standard business supplies and transactions, including directory listings, domain name renewals, promotions, or even office supplies. Unfortunately, it is all too easy to comply with this request without first reporting false information.\u00a0 \u00a0<\/p><p>If you believe you have been the victim of a fake invoice\/billing scam, please contact our fraud investigators urgently. We can uncover actionable evidence from around the world to give you more power to pursue the fraudster and recover your losses.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-32a47e1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"32a47e1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p><strong>Common Types of False Billing Schemes<\/strong><\/p><p>One prevalent type of false billing scheme is the fake directory and promotion scam. These scams typically involve a deceptive request for you to provide your business contact information and signature. In return, you may be promised an exclusive deal. However, unbeknownst to you, the form you fill out is actually an invoice or contract cleverly designed to hide the true amount owed in minuscule print.<\/p><p>Another variation of this scam involves a subscription proposal or renewal for legitimate directory publishers. The scammers aim to trick your business into paying the invoice without any questions or doubts.<\/p><p>In some cases, the scammer may approach your business claiming that an advertisement has already been booked and ask for confirmation of the details. If you refuse to comply with their payment request, the orchestrator of the scam may resort to threatening legal action to coerce you into submission.<\/p><p>It is crucial to remain vigilant and cautious when dealing with such false billing schemes. By being aware of these tactics, you can protect your business from falling victim to these deceitful practices.<\/p><p><strong>Payment redirection fraud<\/strong><\/p><p>Payment redirection fraud is a deceitful scheme in which scammers exploit hacked information to assume the identity of one of your trusted suppliers. They cunningly assert that they have updated their banking details, often going to the extent of incorporating stolen letterheads and branding in their communications to appear authentic.<\/p><p>The primary objective of these fraudsters is to redirect any forthcoming payments to their own bank account, leaving you completely unaware of the deception until your genuine supplier raises concerns about their unpaid invoices. This form of fraud can have severe financial repercussions for your business.<\/p><p><strong>Office supply scams<\/strong><\/p><p>Another fraudulent practice that plagues businesses is the office supply scam. This deceptive tactic involves the scammers sending you unsolicited goods or services, such as stationery or advertising, and subsequently charging you for them. These scammers may masquerade as your regular supplier, reaching out to you via phone or email to entice you with a so-called \u201cspecial offer.\u201d However, the reality is that these items are often exorbitantly priced and of subpar quality.<\/p><p>To compound matters, you may also find yourself burdened with an unexpected invoice or notice, falsely claiming that you have entered into an ongoing supplier contract. The perpetrators of this scam rely on your willingness to pay without thoroughly verifying the legitimacy of the claim.<\/p><p>It is crucial to remain vigilant and adopt stringent measures to protect your business from falling victim to these fraudulent schemes. By staying informed and implementing robust verification processes, you can safeguard your financial interests and maintain the integrity of your supplier relationships.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9c7127 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f9c7127\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><div><div><p><strong>False billing scheme investigators with a proven track record<\/strong><\/p><p>False billing scheme investigators with a proven track record and global reputation, MTGride is widely recognized for its unparalleled ability to uncover evidence and combat false billing scams. Our team of highly skilled investigators, researchers, and analysts possess exceptional expertise in bringing the truth to light.<\/p><p>Our investigations are dynamic and constantly evolving, adapting to each new discovery in false billing schemes. We leverage direct access to local databases, collaborate with expert witnesses in cyber fraud, and maintain a network of confidential informants to ensure the most effective results.<\/p><p>Invaluable connections are at the core of our investigative approach. Our investigators have established powerful relationships with state, federal, and international law enforcement agencies worldwide. Additionally, we collaborate with local and foreign correspondent lawyers to trace money trails and locate hidden assets in almost any jurisdiction.<\/p><p>We understand the devastating financial impact of falling victim to a false billing scam. To assist you in seeking justice and recovering your losses, we provide a comprehensive brief of evidence that can be utilized in criminal proceedings within the relevant jurisdiction.<\/p><p>At MTGride, we prioritize complete discretion in every false billing scheme investigation. Our actions are guided by unmatched professionalism and sensitivity. Rest assured that all personal data is encrypted to safeguard your privacy. Confidential case details will only be disclosed with your explicit consent.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-38fbb67 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"38fbb67\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><span class=\"elementskit-section-subtitle  elementskit-style-border\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFrequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6222d33 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"6222d33\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-69343dfdc48e0\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card active\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-6222d33\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-14514dc69343dfdc48e0\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-14514dc69343dfdc48e0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-14514dc69343dfdc48e0\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What is false billing?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 0.499999L16 0.5L16 2.5L-2.78554e-07 2.5L-2.08616e-07 0.499999Z\" fill=\"#675AFE\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-14514dc69343dfdc48e0\" class=\" show collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-0-6222d33\" data-parent=\"#accordion-69343dfdc48e0\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>False billing refers to scams that ask you or your business to pay a fraudulent invoice for marketing, directory listings, domain services, or supplies that you never actually ordered.<\/p><p>One of the most common forms of billing schemes is operated through a shell company, which is a fake entity set up exclusively for anonymity. As a result, tracking funds going into and out of their accounts becomes extremely challenging. To identify shell company schemes, you can organize payments by vendor, invoice number, amount, and physical address. This sorting process will help highlight any red flags, such as a lack of detail on invoices.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-1-6222d33\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-35c8fe469343dfdc48e0\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-35c8fe469343dfdc48e0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-35c8fe469343dfdc48e0\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How does a false billing scheme work?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 0.499999L16 0.5L16 2.5L-2.78554e-07 2.5L-2.08616e-07 0.499999Z\" fill=\"#675AFE\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-35c8fe469343dfdc48e0\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-1-6222d33\" data-parent=\"#accordion-69343dfdc48e0\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>A false billing scheme usually consists of three key components:<\/p><ol><li>The scammer sends a fraudulent invoice to the victim, requesting payment for goods or services that were never ordered or received.<\/li><li>The victim, unaware of the scam, pays the invoice, believing it to be legitimate.<\/li><li>The scammer receives the payment, converts the money into crypto and disappears, leaving the victim with financial losses.<\/li><\/ol>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-2-6222d33\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-c29457c69343dfdc48e0\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-c29457c69343dfdc48e0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-c29457c69343dfdc48e0\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How do I protect myself against a false billing scheme?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 0.499999L16 0.5L16 2.5L-2.78554e-07 2.5L-2.08616e-07 0.499999Z\" fill=\"#675AFE\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-c29457c69343dfdc48e0\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-6222d33\" data-parent=\"#accordion-69343dfdc48e0\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>There are several steps you can take to protect yourself against a false billing scheme:<\/p><ol><li>Implement a thorough review process for all invoices received, verifying their legitimacy before making any payments.<\/li><li>Train employees to recognize warning signs and report any suspicious invoices or requests for payment.<\/li><li>Maintain a record of all orders and confirmations to compare against received invoices.<\/li><li>Establish clear communication channels with vendors to confirm the authenticity of invoices.<\/li><li>Regularly review and update your company\u2019s internal controls and procedures to prevent fraudulent activities.<\/li><\/ol>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-3-6222d33\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-ea2f60a69343dfdc48e0\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-ea2f60a69343dfdc48e0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-ea2f60a69343dfdc48e0\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How can I report medical billing fraud?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 0.499999L16 0.5L16 2.5L-2.78554e-07 2.5L-2.08616e-07 0.499999Z\" fill=\"#675AFE\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-ea2f60a69343dfdc48e0\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-3-6222d33\" data-parent=\"#accordion-69343dfdc48e0\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>If you suspect that you have fallen victim to medical billing fraud, it is crucial to take immediate action by following the steps outlined below:<\/p><ol><li>Contact our financial institution(s) without delay to inform them about the scam. They will be able to freeze your accounts and credit cards to prevent further unauthorized transactions.<\/li><li>Notify your local police about any stolen funds resulting from the fraud.<\/li><li>It is highly recommended to reach out to MT5 as soon as possible to schedule a consultation for your investigation.<\/li><\/ol>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-4-6222d33\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-207c98b69343dfdc48e0\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-207c98b69343dfdc48e0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-207c98b69343dfdc48e0\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How long does a false billing scheme investigation typically take?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 0.499999L16 0.5L16 2.5L-2.78554e-07 2.5L-2.08616e-07 0.499999Z\" fill=\"#675AFE\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-207c98b69343dfdc48e0\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-4-6222d33\" data-parent=\"#accordion-69343dfdc48e0\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>False billing schemes generally require one to three months for a thorough investigation, although this timeframe is only an estimate. The duration of your investigation ultimately depends on the complexity of the scheme and whether you intend to pursue legal action against the scammer.<\/p><p>If the mastermind behind the scheme is successfully identified, our investigators can collaborate with law enforcement officials to obtain search warrants and potentially press criminal charges. However, this process is intricate and time-consuming, which may extend the overall investigation timeline.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-5-6222d33\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-ba08c8e69343dfdc48e0\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-ba08c8e69343dfdc48e0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-ba08c8e69343dfdc48e0\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What are the costs associated with investigating a false billing scheme?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 0.499999L16 0.5L16 2.5L-2.78554e-07 2.5L-2.08616e-07 0.499999Z\" fill=\"#675AFE\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-ba08c8e69343dfdc48e0\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-5-6222d33\" data-parent=\"#accordion-69343dfdc48e0\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>The expenses involved in investigating a false billing scam vary based on its complexity, scale, the extent of financial losses incurred, and the jurisdiction in which the scheme was executed.<\/p><p>Before commencing the investigation, our investigators will provide you with a personalized proposal that outlines the recommended budget to maximize the chances of achieving a successful outcome.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-6-6222d33\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-a207d4769343dfdc48e0\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-a207d4769343dfdc48e0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-a207d4769343dfdc48e0\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What is the likelihood of a successful investigation?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 0.499999L16 0.5L16 2.5L-2.78554e-07 2.5L-2.08616e-07 0.499999Z\" fill=\"#675AFE\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-a207d4769343dfdc48e0\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-6-6222d33\" data-parent=\"#accordion-69343dfdc48e0\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>The likelihood of a successful investigation hinges on the specific circumstances surrounding your case. The more substantial and actionable evidence our investigators gather, the higher the probability of equipping you with the necessary grounds to pursue legal action against the fraud.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                                        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>has extensive experienc